(Not a spoiler, I know.)

I have seen 'killed by a gug' for only a few high-level Slash'EM 
characters, so I guess they're 1) rare (at least until late game) and 2) 
pretty dangerous.

If you find "SPOIL", The Automatic NetHack Spoiler Generator (Internet 
Archive link: <http://tinyurl.com/4y397>), still available somewhere you 
should be able to make your own excellent Slash'EM spoilers with some 
hassle. (Alas, the "spoil.slashem-0.0.6E4F5.txt" available from that 
page does not include gugs. It seems they were not in the Slash'EM 
version it was based on.)

